          "@id": "gpc:r-2026-06-01-er-residential",
          "urpx:name": "Eligibility for Schedule R Residential Service",
          "urpx:description": "For all domestic uses of a Residential Customer in a separately or commonly metered dwelling unit, as the Company's Rules and Regulations for Electric Service define a Residential Customer. Available throughout the Company's service area from existing lines of adequate capacity; single or three phase, 60 hertz, at a standard voltage.",
